spans.s:
द्रुण, अस्, m. a scorpion; a bee; a rogue, cheat;
(ई), f. a small or female tortoise; an oval vessel or
basin of wood &c. (shaped like a boat and used for
pouring or baling out water; cf. द्रोण and द्रोणी);
a bucket, a basket; a centipede; (आ), f. a bow-string;
(अम्), n. a bow; a sword, scimitar; [cf. द्रु-णह.]
